codex
I found a concrete headless fallback gap: when `event-fast-par` or `event-fast-worker` falls back away from a real worker, the fallback host has no `stepAsync`, so step-based callers can silently no-op. I’m patching that fallback runner to support reset/step lifecycle without touching `dt` or `event`.
